window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v26-021-2052bb362748fb84.json"]={sha256:"2052bb362748fb84ef52bfa7823dd9a93147080d84ea733f5df04c0ed93fab9d",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v26-case-969df2bf493d6959","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/cuda-c-best-practices-guide/","title":"CUDA Best Practices Guide","titleEn":"CUDA Best Practices Guide","publisher":"NVIDIA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-021","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-021","related":[{"id":"hpc-v26-022","referenceUrls":["https://rocm.docs.amd.com/projects/HIP/en/latest/index.html"],"title":"HIP：Wavefront 假設與可攜分組","titleEn":"HIP: wavefront assumptions and portable grouping","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付grid索引、尾端測試與區塊大小實驗表；4/8可重算，所有1000輸出正確且額外槽不修改資料；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver grid indices, tail tests and block-size experiments. Reproduce 4/8 with 1000 correct outputs and no writes from extra slots. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"畫邏輯執行緒0..255及各群組邊界，將群組寬度寫成參數；4/8與32640核對成功，所有群組輸出都被消費一次。","differenceEn":"Map logical threads 0..255 and group boundaries with parameterized width. Verify 4/8 and 32640 with every partial consumed exactly once.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["grid=ceil(N/block)，總啟動槽grid×block；僅i\u003cN的執行緒可寫輸出；合成N1000，block256對128，核函數每有效索引寫i²；名義式 ceil(1000/256) = 4 blocks；變更式 ceil(1000/128) = 8 blocks。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","教學群組數G=ceil(T/W)，W是本次裝置能力模型；不是所有AMD裝置的固定值；一block T=256執行緒；合成W64與W32比較，兩者各自獨立能力情境；名義式 ceil(256/64) = 4 execution groups/block；變更式 ceil(256/32) = 8 execution groups/block。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["grid=ceil(N/block), launched slots=grid×block; only i\u003cN may write outputs. Synthetic N 1000, block 256 versus 128; each valid index writes i². Nominal ceil(1000/256) = 4 blocks; changed ceil(1000/128) = 8 blocks. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Teaching group count G=ceil(T/W), where W belongs to the selected device model, not all AMD devices. T 256 threads/block; compare separate synthetic device models W 64 and W 32. Nominal ceil(256/64) = 4 execution groups/block; changed ceil(256/32) = 8 execution groups/block. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v26-031","referenceUrls":["https://hypre.readthedocs.io/en/latest/"],"title":"hypre 多重網格：粗網格修正與收縮因子","titleEn":"hypre multigrid: coarse correction and contraction","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付grid索引、尾端測試與區塊大小實驗表；4/8可重算，所有1000輸出正確且額外槽不修改資料；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver grid indices, tail tests and block-size experiments. Reproduce 4/8 with 1000 correct outputs and no writes from extra slots. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"畫細網格平滑、限制、粗解、延拓、後平滑；在各層標未知數與邊界；.0016/.0256可重算，實際逐輪q若變動則撤回固定q預測。","differenceEn":"Draw smoothing, restriction, coarse solve, prolongation, and post-smoothing. Label unknowns and boundaries on every level. Reproduce 0.0016 and 0.0256. Withdraw constant-q predictions if observed contraction changes.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["grid=ceil(N/block)，總啟動槽grid×block；僅i\u003cN的執行緒可寫輸出；合成N1000，block256對128，核函數每有效索引寫i²；名義式 ceil(1000/256) = 4 blocks；變更式 ceil(1000/128) = 8 blocks。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","假設每V-cycle使殘差乘q，k輪後r_k=r0q^k；固定q是教學近似而非普遍保證；合成r0=1、q=.2、k4；另一平滑器q=.4，其餘相同；名義式 1*.2**4 = 0.0016 residual norm model；變更式 1*.4**4 = 0.0256 residual norm model。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["grid=ceil(N/block), launched slots=grid×block; only i\u003cN may write outputs. Synthetic N 1000, block 256 versus 128; each valid index writes i². Nominal ceil(1000/256) = 4 blocks; changed ceil(1000/128) = 8 blocks. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","If each V-cycle multiplies the residual by q, then r_k = r0 q^k. Constant q is a teaching approximation, not a universal guarantee. Synthetic r0 = 1, q = 0.2, and k = 4; compare a smoother with q = 0.4. Nominal 1*.2**4 = 0.0016 residual norm model; changed 1*.4**4 = 0.0256 residual norm model. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v26-case-1924b759af2fd4d0","url":"https://rocm.docs.amd.com/projects/HIP/en/latest/index.html","title":"HIP documentation","titleEn":"HIP documentation","publisher":"AMD ROCm","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-5d4c3c8afc6671a2","url":"https://hypre.readthedocs.io/en/latest/","title":"hypre documentation","titleEn":"hypre documentation","publisher":"hypre development team / LLNL","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
